{
    "title": "Stronghold Dude: Dragon Rising",
    "description": "Welcome to Stronghold Dude: Build Your Medieval Empire.  \r\n \r\nAre you ready to start your epic journey and build your own city and empire? Dive into the immersive world of Stronghold Dude, a tycoon games that lets you shape your success story! Try to survive in this epic world full of battles, stories about knights and princesses and legendary dragons. \r\n \r\nDownload Stronghold Dude: Battles and Conquest now and play for absolute FREE, a game of survival, tactics, planning, battles and magical adventures. \r\n \r\n\ud83d\udc8e Resources are the basis of prosperity \ud83d\udc8e \r\nEffective management of resources is the key to the success of any civilization. Create an optimal system of collection, storage and distribution of resources. \r\n \r\n\ud83c\udff0 Expand your Kingdom \ud83c\udff0  \r\nBy building sawmills and weapons workshops, we contribute to the development of our civilization, transforming it from a peaceful settlement into a powerful military power. Gather resources, strengthen your army, build a powerful economy, and defend your borders. \r\n \r\n\ud83d\udc09 Grow your own Battle Dragon! \ud83d\udc09 \r\nYour dragon will evolve from a hatchling to a fearsome adult. \r\nEquip it with armor, sharpen its claws, and unleash it in epic battles. \r\n \r\n\u2694\ufe0f Fight the Robbers and Defeat the Formidable Bosses \u2694\ufe0f \r\nEnjoy awesome raids and epic battles in Stronghold Dude: Fight & Survive. Improve your fighting skills and become a real knight capable of protecting your settlement. Destroy bosses in epic clashes and collect magical rewards. And the main goal is to save the princess from the hands of the evil king. \r\n \r\n\ud83d\udc51 Command your own army \ud83d\udc51 \r\nCraft a variety of weapons in the armory, providing the army with a deadly tool for defense. Recruit new warriors and improve their skills in battles. Your army becomes your shield against invaders and a force to reckon with on the battlefield. \r\n \r\nChoose your own strategy for the development of your kingdom. Will you be a benevolent ruler, a cunning strategist, or a ruthless conqueror? Tycoon games let you make this choice, choose correctly - the survive of your medieval empire lies in your hands! \ud83c\udff0\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f\ud83c\udf1f",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Stronghold Dude: Build Your Medieval Empire.  <br> <br>Are you ready to start your epic journey and build your own city and empire? Dive into the immersive world of Stronghold Dude, a tycoon games that lets you shape your success story! Try to survive in this epic world full of battles, stories about knights and princesses and legendary dragons. <br> <br>Download Stronghold Dude: Battles and Conquest now and play for absolute FREE, a game of survival, tactics, planning, battles and magical adventures. <br> <br>\ud83d\udc8e Resources are the basis of prosperity \ud83d\udc8e <br>Effective management of resources is the key to the success of any civilization. Create an optimal system of collection, storage and distribution of resources. <br> <br>\ud83c\udff0 Expand your Kingdom \ud83c\udff0  <br>By building sawmills and weapons workshops, we contribute to the development of our civilization, transforming it from a peaceful settlement into a powerful military power. Gather resources, strengthen your army, build a powerful economy, and defend your borders. <br> <br>\ud83d\udc09 Grow your own Battle Dragon! \ud83d\udc09 <br>Your dragon will evolve from a hatchling to a fearsome adult. <br>Equip it with armor, sharpen its claws, and unleash it in epic battles. <br> <br>\u2694\ufe0f Fight the Robbers and Defeat the Formidable Bosses \u2694\ufe0f <br>Enjoy awesome raids and epic battles in Stronghold Dude: Fight &amp; Survive. Improve your fighting skills and become a real knight capable of protecting your settlement. Destroy bosses in epic clashes and collect magical rewards. And the main goal is to save the princess from the hands of the evil king. <br> <br>\ud83d\udc51 Command your own army \ud83d\udc51 <br>Craft a variety of weapons in the armory, providing the army with a deadly tool for defense. Recruit new warriors and improve their skills in battles. Your army becomes your shield against invaders and a force to reckon with on the battlefield. <br> <br>Choose your own strategy for the development of your kingdom. Will you be a benevolent ruler, a cunning strategist, or a ruthless conqueror? Tycoon games let you make this choice, choose correctly - the survive of your medieval empire lies in your hands! \ud83c\udff0\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f\ud83c\udf1f",
